Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(900,800)\pos(312,390)}这个总集篇由于制作的原因
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(900,800)\pos(350,415)}和正篇相比存在着一定的画质不足
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(900,800)\pos(262,440)}在此预先请您原谅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.90,0:00:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世谓缘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,系结的丝线纠结缠绕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:15.70,0:00:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.30,0:00:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在愤怒 悲伤 泪水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零点的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难消之恨 愿为消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.10,0:00:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.50,0:00:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:48.20,0:00:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.60,0:00:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.80,0:01:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.10,0:01:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:09.30,0:01:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.60,0:01:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.40,0:01:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
