Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.90,0:01:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.70,0:01:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.20,0:01:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.70,0:01:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.50,0:01:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.00,0:02:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.40,0:02:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 现在就去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人只要活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.70,0:02:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会对那么一两个人有“要是没这家伙就好了”的想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.30,0:02:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是世上有社会和秩序啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人恰如其分地保持自己心里的平衡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好活下去的人占大多数
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能保持平衡就好了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.30,0:03:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中也有被逼得走投无路的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.40,0:03:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺凌 嫉妒 背叛 自私
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.80,0:03:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些被作为感情和欲望宣泄对象的人简直惨不忍睹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.30,0:03:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用说  处于弱势的人更是如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.80,0:03:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是一路看着这样的人过来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下借你的全还清了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.30,0:03:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.50,0:03:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前还的只是利息哦 利息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么怨言么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有我借给你的话会怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果讨厌的话就告诉大家好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.80,0:03:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说我保管的钱弄丢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.40,0:03:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有点口渴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去买果汁来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.50,0:03:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到一个奇怪的传言啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.10,0:04:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说你夜晚在外面游荡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我觉得肯定是毫无根据的传言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被抓住把柄的话就会让人有机可乘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来 人就变得不可信了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.60,0:04:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了啊 你的脸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近你好奇怪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我不愿意这么想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道最近家里不见的钱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈是相信你的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岩下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.70,0:04:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教练
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是刑警
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你将他从堤坝上推了下去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.70,0:05:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.40,0:05:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过呢 从验尸结果看如果不用棒状物体殴打的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会造成这样的伤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 岩下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.30,0:05:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人犯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.90,0:05:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把伸一还给我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 冷静点啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室…室井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.70,0:05:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.00,0:05:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩是一个中学的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.70,0:05:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道室井家的对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我送他回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.60,0:05:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但 但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了 岩下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们应该知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们两个闹着玩从堤坝上摔下来的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.50,0:06:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了 岩下 我求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 他就拜托你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}我该怎么做好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知不觉中落入了陷阱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.30,0:06:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}总之 求你们了 请相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.80,0:06:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现时事情已经一发不可收拾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.80,0:06:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}迷路的 迷路的 小猫咪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用自己的地位及立场
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出无赖行径的人也是有的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位刑警吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在掌握确凿的证据之前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就请您再稍微忍耐一阵了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.10,0:06:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如月先生 我女儿已经忍到极限了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.90,0:06:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs30\pos(550,160)\frz6}爱你啊\N\N凉子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.80,0:06:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.40,0:06:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鹰村先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.60,0:06:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滥用职权的跟踪狂警官
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.40,0:06:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思来晚了 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.60,0:07:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刑警先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.80,0:07:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 拜托你不要死啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.20,0:07:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要丢下我一个人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.30,0:07:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实在那个时候议员河合先生打电话来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高尔夫吗 我是没问题啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.50,0:07:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一起去的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是给河合先生添麻烦吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}是 月底的星期二吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}我正好有空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据客人的地位安排工作时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.30,0:07:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜金主义 道德败坏的兽医
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}不不 完全没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那Candy不是没有接受任何诊治吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电话挂断后虽然进行了治疗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.80,0:07:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那时已经太晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.40,0:07:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.40,0:08:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没有带你去看那种医生就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所发现的尸体是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小林徹 33岁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.40,0:08:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经营电脑…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.50,0:08:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是小林徹 33岁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用什么方法就看你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽快干掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下总算
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算怎样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下总算能让警察逮捕我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追究其他罪行的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.30,0:08:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死你父亲的证据也会出现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的行动全被看穿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.40,0:08:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有 有人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.60,0:08:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警卫刚才已被这家伙收拾掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.80,0:08:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人的性命难道不值一提吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.50,0:08:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是杀一个和杀几个都一样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.70,0:09:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这样把公司搞大的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.70,0:09:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对会下地狱的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是几十年后的事了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.70,0:09:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生说到底就是场游戏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束前享乐的人就是赢家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自我中心的女社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.80,0:09:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 安田太太 早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.50,0:09:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您家的女儿被编到我家女儿那个班了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.30,0:09:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间如果也能和睦相处就好了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.60,0:09:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为宣泄搞外遇被当场看到的愤怒 对人百般刁难
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.60,0:09:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公司宿舍的贵妇 分公司经理夫人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.60,0:09:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 振作点啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 为什么要做这种事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.50,0:10:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了 住在这里要是惹恼了那个人就算完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.20,0:10:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我会这么倒霉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是户高她自己不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.00,0:10:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,户高太太？ 到底发生了什么事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是弘美小姐做的么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请尝尝看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有恩将仇报的当红糕点师啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.70,0:10:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 森崎先生那里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.80,0:10:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 要是把姐姐的蛋糕带去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.70,0:10:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就帮忙在街角蛋糕节目中宣传咱们的店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.20,0:10:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个节目很受欢迎的 正好能做宣传
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.20,0:10:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天首先由请森崎先生来介绍他的新作蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个蛋糕叫什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的名字是“微醉”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18\fad(300,300)}Ivresse      法语【微醉】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面用了神秘的材料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就照例叫出伊藤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊藤小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.00,0:11:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.60,0:11:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 请她们马上介绍一下点心吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.00,0:11:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我店的主打蛋糕“遗产”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18\fad(300,300)}Héritage    法语【遗产】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.20,0:11:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个店吧 最近剽窃森崎的蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.90,0:11:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说是原来的徒弟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.20,0:11:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快会倒闭的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 估计是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.20,0:11:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然只是个传言吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法求助于法律
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.20,0:12:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弱者们就怀着抓住救命稻草的心思 向小姐求救
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.80,0:12:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向地狱少女求救
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.10,0:12:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼唤我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是阎魔爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呼唤我来的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮我消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将那红线解开即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.70,0:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开绳线
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.30,0:13:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式缔结了契约
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.10,0:13:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人将立刻坠入地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.30,0:13:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.50,0:13:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.90,0:13:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦将付出代价
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.80,0:13:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代价
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人终害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂将坠入地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法前往极乐净土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.40,0:13:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂将饱尝痛楚与苦难
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.50,0:14:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到这就必须做出极端的选择了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.60,0:14:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这么容易就让人一个个地消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上的人不用多久就全消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管如何选择
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.40,0:14:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是否缔结契约必须由自己抉择
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.30,0:14:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开这根红线的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨就能消除了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.10,0:14:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办不到 办不到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我吧 Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy那么痛苦地死去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桥本
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.90,0:14:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你谈谈么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在刚才 学校收到了邮件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.20,0:15:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要辩解了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.10,0:15:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面的人的确是你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.60,0:15:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得羞耻吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为中学生竟然做成这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.00,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还很相信你 可惜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.60,0:15:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 希望请你的父母明天来一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.60,0:15:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去明年的高中保送也会变得很困难吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我还要感谢你和室井呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.80,0:15:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏你们 可以不用参加大赛了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.70,0:15:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部员们可能想要留些青春的回忆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.50,0:15:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过为了这个就要耗损我的肩膀就有点…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐 难道说是故意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意的话 你又想怎样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.60,0:15:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经够了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.00,0:16:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井他 室井他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛苦地 痛苦地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.90,0:16:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.50,0:16:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我又没有看见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊 为什么 为什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有你的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.20,0:16:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不会有这么痛苦的回忆了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.70,0:16:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么痛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爱让你哪里痛苦了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.10,0:16:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.90,0:16:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凉子 我在问你痛苦什么了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.70,0:16:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正只是这附近捡来的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.40,0:16:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种狗跑来只会把医院弄脏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄的臭气熏天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是什么地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.20,0:16:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种狗 为了医院也应该早点死比较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.40,0:16:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这全是户高太太她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 不要再说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.70,0:16:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不能相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 根本连听都不听我说吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.70,0:17:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直 一直你只顾着自己的工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.70,0:17:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厚颜无耻地亲近姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.90,0:17:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拒绝了就做出这种事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.10,0:17:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太差劲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被甩掉是当然的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么都随便你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在店也回不来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:23.80,0:17:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我很感谢你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.50,0:17:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你给了我绝好的复仇机会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没想到会那么顺利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.60,0:17:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久没这么痛快了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.60,0:17:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就拼命工作还债吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原谅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.20,0:17:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然说早点死比较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原谅 不能原谅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界才是地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要那个人还活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.70,0:18:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.40,0:18:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凉子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 闻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.10,0:19:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠 花笠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.80,0:19:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人凶手 杀人凶手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.50,0:19:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弘美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森崎先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也对您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:23.30,0:19:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了 尝尝我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.70,0:19:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要做这种事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.80,0:19:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 不是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.10,0:19:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞外遇的原来是户高啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:39.90,0:19:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只发情的母狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子丢脸丢大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底是谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.60,0:19:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨头断了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.10,0:19:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.00,0:19:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟敢让我女儿如此痛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱的入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说过轮到你了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:16.40,0:20:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是稍微会打点的程度而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.90,0:20:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是被称为十年难得一见的奇才啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不能打棒球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.50,0:20:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日本 不 是对世界职业棒球界来说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会给带来多大的损失你不知道吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.60,0:20:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的腿受伤了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.50,0:20:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对自己的所作所为有所悔悟了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有什么错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有错的是凉子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.20,0:20:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背叛的一方才有错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都是她的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.30,0:20:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是认真地喜欢她的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.30,0:20:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我一直这么多关照她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她辜负了我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.80,0:20:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.30,0:20:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是戏弄了她一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是闹着玩的 闹着玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.30,0:20:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没做什么坏事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她这么说哦 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失于黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:07.10,0:21:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤害鄙视他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.50,0:21:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺于罪恶的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢 慢着 想要把我带到哪里去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.80,0:21:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到底是什么地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.10,0:21:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道呢 到底是哪里呢 亲爱的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么 放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.80,0:21:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要过来 不要过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:02.60,0:22:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将流向地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消除了怨恨的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.30,0:22:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就迎来了平静的生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:20.00,0:22:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像什么都没发生过一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.50,0:22:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不管之后是多么幸福的人生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.30,0:22:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这世上尽头等待着的却是无尽的地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.50,0:22:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铭记下的刻印
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.00,0:22:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你想忘也忘不掉的那份见证
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.50,0:22:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了也是地狱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:42.20,0:22:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着也是地狱啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.80,0:22:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后也会有很多人登录地狱通信吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要还有胸怀怨恨的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:58.70,0:23:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我们只遵从小姐的意识行动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来死一次吧
